  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bhvtrVOWI2s?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>此專案也可以在&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0f0\"><a style=\"color:#0f0\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmore-cave-sounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></span>&nbsp;和 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fmore-cave-sounds%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planetminecraft</a></span> 上找到</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>在原有洞穴音效基礎上，新增更多符合原版風格的洞穴音效，提升多樣性與沉浸感。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模組主要為個人需求製作，不確定在其他版本相容性如何，但推測至少從1.13版開始應可正常運作。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">音效製作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://youtube.com/@skexofiner.nsystemz?si=kbEAliCXRImUUGgA\" rel=\"nofollow\">Langzorth</a></p>",
